PROCEDURE initializeDBOs :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
IF NOT VALID-HANDLE({&hDBOTable}) OR 
         {&hDBOTable}:TYPE <> "PROCEDURE":U OR
         {&hDBOTable}:FILE-NAME <> "frbo~\bofr011.p":U THEN DO:
        RUN frbo/bofr011.p PERSISTENT SET  {&hDBOTable}.
END.
RUN openQueryStatic in   {&hDBOTable} (input "Main":U) NO-ERROR.




     
RETURN "OK":U.    
END PROCEDURE.

